  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1802.21 Legal address",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1802.21 “Legal address” means specification of the location where a person makes their residence. The term does not include addresses consisting solely of a post office box number.\n\nSource. #8405, eff 8-2-05 (formerly Saf-C 1801.19); ss by #10523, eff 2-18-14, EXPIRED: 2-18-24\n\nNew. #13963, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 5-13-24; ss by #14100, eff 10-18-24, EXPIRES: 10-18-34",
